// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CeruleanDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2336765165" "{HeroName}, I felt a great disruption ripple through the magical ley lines that crisscross First Ward. What has happened?"
// Answer Text :
"P981722187" "Diabolique has been captured"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P4103571651" "Captured?! By whom?"
// Answer Text :
"P2447789771" "A woman named Serene"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2636654944" "Serene? Who is she?<br><br>{HeroName}, this is very important. If this Serene could capture Diabolique then she could be a powerful ally in our fight against Master Midnight..."
// Answer Text :
"P3246152617" "About that... (Explain your conversation with Master Midnight)"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P618651320" "<color orange>Cerulean grows angry</color><br><br>{HeroName}, you cannot be serious! Master Midnight is a murderous betrayer! He cannot be trusted!"
// Answer Text :
"P1939438600" "Cerulean, Serene has unleashed the Talons of Vengeance"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P3017384583" "<color orange>Cerulean is taken aback</color><br><br>No...<br><br>No! That's... How can that be?<br><br>I... I have to discuss this with the Carnival. I have to mobilize the Carnival of War immediately!<br><br>Dammit, I warned them this might happen..."
// Answer Text :
"P1031701020" "Wait, if we join forces with Midnight..."
// Page Page5 Text :
"P3145075948" "NO!<br><br>There will be no alliance with Midnight! For all we know he's helping this Serene individual!<br><br>You would do well to remember just what sort of monster Midnight is!"
// Answer Text :
"P678471749" "Cerulean, we have bigger problems than Midnight"
// Page Page6 Text :
"P266325249" "I agree and that's why I am acting now and taking the Carnival to war. If we don't stop the Talons now then all will be lost.<br><br>You can get stabbed in the back by Midnight if you want, but if I see that slime ball, he's a dead man!"
// Answer Text :
"P1777513999" "You do what you need to do, I'll do what I need to do."
// Page Page7 Text :
"P2253339797" "Come and see the Carnival when it readies for war, {HeroName}, then you will see that Midnight's 'assistance' is unneeded and his wish to join us is solely for his own survival."
// Answer Text :
"P3613981897" "(Go with Cerulean to see the Carnival of War)"
// Answer Text :
"P337172684" "I'm not ready yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeVoreDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1937022148" "I know, {HeroName}... The Talons of Vengeance are free, and they have just stolen many lives from us...<br><br>Cerulean is blinded by his hatred of Midnight, and how well that distrust has served him in the past. But now is not the time for us to grow apart, it is the time for us to come together."
// Answer Text :
"P1668749118" "So the Carnival will join forces with Master Midnight?"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P4101895327" "The Carnival of Light, yes..."
// Answer Text :
"P3123288745" "But not Cerulean?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1838158567" "Cerulean has long had the loyalty of the Carnival of War and seeks now to take the fight to the Talons...<br><br>I fear that rage has blinded him to the folly of attacking the Talons divided as we are. Perhaps he hoped that when push came to shove I would follow him and bring the Carnival with me. If only it were that simple...<br><br> My only hope is that working with Master Midnight can reveal a plan to stop the Talons before Cerulean's life ends in tragedy..."
// Answer Text :
"P2111229615" "You deal with Cerulean, I'll work with Midnight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MasterMidnightDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P676725893" "I take it things went poorly? You were gone for quite some time... I guess we'll just have to do it ourselves, the few against the many..."
// Answer Text :
"P3461973532" "The Carnival of Light will assist you..."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P359974873" "What?! Really?<br><br>That was easy!<br><br>I mean, it was easy for you because you are so {hero.gender=male intimidating!|beautiful, persuasive, and undeniable... a woman who knows what she wants and knows how to get it.}<br><br>So... How'd you convince them to see the wisdom in teaming up?"
// Answer Text :
"P49042582" "The Talons attacked the Carnival, but we fended them off."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2058546781" "Ho ho! So the Talons draw first blood!<br><br>I see the Carnival needs my help even more than ever!<br><br>Perhaps I should negotiate some additional terms with their mysterious leader. Is it true that beneath that mask of hers is the face of an angel whose eyes sparkle like..."
// Answer Text :
"P1524126423" "Midnight! We haven't much time!"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P1696899184" "Oh! Uh, right!<br><br>I have a book about the Talons somewhere in my collection. I'm sure we can discover a weakness about them in there somewhere."
// Answer Text :
"P920465055" "Go with Midnight to research the Talons (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P1076483967" "I'm not ready yet. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1189215411" "{HeroName}... I appreciate what you did to try and stop that evil sorceress, Serene and her minions. Regretfully I discovered too late the trap that was laid for the delightfully devilish Diabolique, but it is not too late to save her!<br><br><color red>Sorceress Serene</color> is far too powerful and seductive for any one of us to go up against her alone and not become her slave, a fate that is not entirely dire... But no, we will have to join forces if I am to capture Serene and rescue an eternally grateful and potentially scantily clad Diabolique... it will be the stuff of legends!<br><br>Help me to convince the Carnival of Light to put aside our petty differences so we can join forces and become an alliance of unequaled awesomeness!"
// AcceptString :
"P3718301719" "Serene does seem powerful, I'll see what I can do."
// SendOffString :
"P1625556049" "Excellent!<br><br>Let them know that Serene has unleashed the <color red>Talons of Vengeance</color> and they will understand the need for us to join forces.<br><br>As they well know, I have a plethora of magical knowledge in my possession, and I am willing to share in order to rescue my Diabolique from the infernal clutches of an equally beautiful and unattainable magical super vixen!<br><br>Horrible blood thirsty monster women to fight, a beautiful ghost princess to rescue, and a sinister and psychotic sorceress to overthrow. This is going to be the best adventure ever!"
// TaskTitle :
"P1934358999" "<color deepskyblue>Revenge: Serve Chilled</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P621023673" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Burying Hatchets</color>"

