// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2315218244" "You helped Cerulean repel the Talons of Vengeance assault upon the Carnival of War."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2573376295" "Speak to Cerulean"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2740597341" "Cerulean seems to be my biggest obstacle in securing an alliance. Speak with him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2231995695" "You see? The Talons fear the Carnival of War. Why else would they have conducted an immediate attack upon us if they weren't afraid of our strength?<br><br>The losses were high, but thanks to your efforts they were not so devastating that we cannot recover from them. The time to counter attack is now, and I must make sure that the Carnival of War is assembled and prepared.<br><br>See to it that DeVore knows my intentions. I pray that she has insight enough to join me in the fight against the Talons rather than entertain this silly proposal from Master Midnight and wait on the sidelines as usual.<br><br>I have more pressing matters to attend to..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3949972589" "Talk to Vanessa DeVore about the Alliance"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P78635693" "Perhaps Vanessa DeVore would be more willing to have me as an ally."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3945592971" "You secured an alliance between the Carnival of Light and Master Midnight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1411981725" "Work with Master Midnight"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1630306785" "Together we will do great things."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P864214493" "You appear inside of the Midnight Mansion and are immediately aware that the place is under attack... by the Carnival of War."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYINFO 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

