// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Greeting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Dialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - DialogStartPage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P1694866840" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DodgerBlue>Well, well, well. If it isn't the betrayer and the fool that follows him.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DodgerBlue>Did you really think I would sit by idly and let Master Midnight use you to cement his power base?<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DodgerBlue>Don't take it personaly, {HeroName}, we simply disagree on whether Midnight is trustworthy.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DodgerBlue>We still have the same goal; to stop the Talons of Vengeance. It's just I'll do it without showing my back to a traitor..."
// SaysList :
"P1700550030" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DodgerBlue>I have what I came for. It would be best for you to simply let us go.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DodgerBlue>Every one of my Carnival you defeat, is one less I can fight the Talons with. Think about whose side you are really on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - HERO_CRITTER 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - HERO_NAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// HERO_NAME :
"P494595658" "Master Midnight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OVERRIDE_GANG_PET 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3609095116" "What! What is going on?!<em>{HeroName}, what is the meaning of this?<em>Are you betraying me already!?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Greeting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Dialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - DialogStartPage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P1427431890" "<shout>This dastardly attack has bested my defenses!<em>Cerulean, come forth and face me in glorious magical combat, wizard to wizard!<t 4>Or are you afraid!?"
// SaysList :
"P2196035829" "<shout><t 12>Running away?!<t 4>I knew it, you are afraid to face the magnificent Master Midnight!"
// SaysList :
"P605840353" "<shout>I'm not sure what Cerulean was after...<em>Let's put a swift end to these Carnival freaks and figure out what Cerulean stole from me!"

