// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3129347582" "You drove off the Carnival of War from the Midnight Mansion, but Cerulean managed to steal <color yellow>the Chronicles of Doom</color>, a tome detailing the wrath of the Furies throughout history."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBeginFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P485922147" "Cerulean is not playing by the rules. How dare he attack my home and my precious Midnight Masters!<br><br>What is the Carnival of Light going to do about this rogue commanding their forces and spoiling their alliances with all-powerful wizards such as myself!?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BlindMakwaDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3955964514" "Ah, {HeroName}. The sun rises in the west hotter than ever, there is war on the horizon and I sense great fear on the wind.<br><br>What brings you to me?"
// Answer Text :
"P3172529298" "I have a book with a spell to steal spirit sight."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1864963888" "The witch's spell book? You found it!?"
// Answer Text :
"P2269074473" "I'm not sure if it is the same one that stole your sight."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3165645316" "This is wonderful news. But I must ask, how did you come by this book?"
// Answer Text :
"P3449400543" "(Explain the Talons and the alliance with Master Midnight)"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P1098190196" "<color orange>Blind Makwa nods occasionally as you tell your tale. When you mention the name Serene, however, his cloudy eyes widen and his mouth opens with a gasp.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, you must find Nadia and warn her of Serene before it is too late!"
// Answer Text :
"P2568375967" "Is she in danger?"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P2025907831" "Serene was the name of a witch in the same coven as Nadia years long past. There isn't time to explain, but only Nadia can undo Serene's spell and return my sight to me, and Serene undoubtably knows this.<br><br>Nadia is very likely in grave danger!"
// Answer Text :
"P339819390" "(Go warn Nadia)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NadiaDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3854197906" "What can ol' Nadia do for you, chil'?"
// Answer Text :
"P2715915066" "Nadia, you're in danger..."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P2841832956" "Calm, chil', calm. Explain what danger I be in."
// Answer Text :
"P2827680847" "Sorceress Serene has released the Talons of Vengeance."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1904237690" "<color orange>Nadia seems unaffected by this news</color><br><br>So... Sister Serene is alive...<br><br>It must have been she who took Blind Makwa's spirit sight.<br><br>But why would she want me dead? There was never any bad blood 'tween us."
// Answer Text :
"P3086316958" "Because with this book you can restore his sight."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P3632455212" "Ahhh, bless you chil', you be full of surprises this day.<br><br>But you are right, Serene would seek to stop me from returning Blind Makwa's spirit sight. It would show the truth of things.<br><br>{HeroName}, the Talons of Vengeance are killers through and through. If Serene indeed commands them, then your prediction of their arrival is as good as truth."
// Answer Text :
"P2533560110" "We need to get you out of here and to the Chapel."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P3560176634" "The time for that is passed, the Talons be here already. Now is the time when the fates choose how this story will end."
// Answer Text :
"P1134365579" "Would the fates mind if we got inside rather than fight them on this rooftop?"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P876717318" "I cannot speak for the fates, but fate does favor the prepared. Best we do it soon, I can feel the rage of the Talons approaching as we speak."
// Answer Text :
"P2193193898" "Fight the Talons (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P761488027" "I need one second to get ready. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2453900514" "The <color orange>Chronicles of Doom</color> had all the information about the Talons of Vengeance. The only other information I have on them is in this <color orange>old witch's tome describing an ancient and mysterious cavern where they found a source of great and terrible magical power</color>.<br><br>There are a number of spells in it which I have been trying to learn... I mean, as like, a pastime thing, just for fun, not really seriously, you know?<br><br>One of them is <color orange>a spell that can steal the power to see or commune with spirits</color>, the sort of ability a medium possesses."
// AcceptString :
"P2547877102" "Let me see that book"
// SendOffString :
"P635716305" "We need to find that cavern, I'm sure it has something to do with the Talons of Vengeance and Sorceress Serene. It seemed like Diabolique knew Serene from her past, perhaps they were witches in the same coven together.<br><br>While you talk to the Carnival, I am going to be studying Cerulean's little magical doorway. Maybe I can figure out how it works so we can follow him to wherever he went."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2425958035" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Loose Ends</color>"

