"P1430595114" "I... I'm sorry... {HeroName}...<t 2>I was... blinded...<t 2>enchanted...<t 2>by Serene's... promises...<t 2>of justice...<t 2>I... am lost... but you...<t 2>you are not...<t 2>here... take the Ch... Chroni...cles...<t 2>you will see...in their pages...<t 2>what Serene... plans...<t 2>..."
// SaysList :
"P2533795930" "<shout>Well done, Cerulean.<t 2>Your Carnival of War has proven most anxious to join in the carrion feast!<t 2>I promise you that Master Midnight will soon pay for his treacheries!<t 2>But first, you must deal with your guests!<t 2>When you are finished with them go and finish off the rest of the Carnival of Light!"

